  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF Split Library extracts ranges of pages from PDF documents into new PDF documents, from and to files or memory, with document information and security for the new documents.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for 64-bit (x64) applications; for x86 and AnyCPU applications use ExpertPdf.SplitPdf.\n\nFeatures\n- Extract a range of pages into a new PDF document\n- From a file or memory, to a file or memory\n- Password protected source documents\n- Document information and security (passwords, permissions, encryption) of the new documents\n- Get the page count of a document; thread safe",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
  "id": "ExpertPdf.SplitPdf.x64",
