  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0: SourcePdfPassword: split password protected documents. PdfSecurityOptions and PdfDocumentInfo for the new documents. Split at the bookmarks, extract a page list or the odd / even pages, split by maximum file size. Version 10 is part of the ExpertPdf 22.0 release: it requires a version 10 license key.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Split PDF documents and extract page ranges in any .NET application. 64-bit build.",
  "title": "ExpertPdf PDF Split Library for .NET x64",
